# armour/shared/pauldron_lobed3_r: the medium LOBED pauldron on the right shoulder (lobed.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# petals: a round upper petal over a lower one, the outline notched between them and the foot scalloped into
# round lobes, the petals parted by soft dark lines (PARADE, gilded).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the petals' scalloped hem, G the petal's heart, N the line between petals, P the petals' faces.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-lobed` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron lobed.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

